{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>With fat of kidneys of wheat.</b> With choice oil of the finest wheats — like ותכל המלך דוד, which is like ותכל נפש דוד; כלתה נפשי — a term of desire and craving. Another interpretation: coarse wheats resembling kidneys, for since they have a crease and a furrow, it likens them to kidneys."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:02.585287217Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}